    "paragraph": "A global framework was developed to estimate relative urban cycling intensity by weighting crowdsourced Strava Global Heatmap data with population and point of interest counts. Researchers also created GBA-GCs, a multimodal benchmark dataset of over 37,000 residential compounds in China's Greater Bay Area, to map gated communities and analyze their equity implications. Finally, a dynamic charging system was modeled to manage mobile electricity suppliers transferring power to electric vehicles in motion within a platoon.",
